                  "text": "Lif. 22.18-19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Mukhole buli siindu nisio ese mulaka enywe, mukhatasakho sisiindu siosi siosi tawe, namwe murusiekho sisiindu siosi siosi tawe.”",
          "type": "text",
